# Capacitor native wrapper — generated/built ON THE MAC and regenerable from capacitor.config.json
# (npm i @capacitor/* + npx cap add ios android). Kept OUT of git so the Cloudflare Worker, which
# serves the whole repo ([assets] directory="./"), never publishes or trips over them.
/ios/
/android/
/package.json
/package-lock.json
/cap-web/App/

# TestFlight export config + scratch (local only)
native-build/

# NEVER commit signing keys (the Worker serves the whole repo)
*.p8
credentials/

